<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.667 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.667 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.667 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.669 lei on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Mar 5		   Mar 4</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.667		   4.669</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    600,000		 400,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
